ys rugby supports that sport. Missing credibility metadata is not wrong_argument. Return direct only for the requested relation; UK Albums Chart does not define the band or song whose debut is mentioned.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What sport is the Munster Senior Cup associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 184, \"text\": \"Munster Schools Rugby Senior Cup The Munster Schools Senior Cup or Munster Senior Cup is the under-age rugby union competition for schools affiliated to the Munster Branch of the IRFU.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d00\", \"start\": 185, \"end\": 308, \"text\": \"Schools rugby is seen by the IRFU as one of the two channels for players to learn their rugby and advance to senior levels.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d00\", \"start\": 309, \"end\": 544, \"text\": \"This notwithstanding, the schools competitions generate significant interest in their own right whilst old rivalries are re-awakened, and nostalgic memories abound ensuring that nobody who has been through the system remains untouched.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d00\", \"start\": 545, \"end\": 624, \"text\": \"The inaugural Munster Schools Senior Cup took place in 1909 and since then Cork\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 1, \"text\": \".\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d01\", \"start\": 2, \"end\": 74, \"text\": \"`` Stunning second half wins Nenagh Ormond first Munster Senior Cup '' .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d01\", \"start\": 75, \"end\": 91, \"text\": \"Irish Examiner .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d01\", \"start\": 92, \"end\": 117, \"text\": \"Retrieved 17 March 2025 .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d01\", \"start\": 118, \"end\": 688, \"text\": \"v t e Rugby union in Ireland Irish Rugby Football Union National teams Men 's Senior Sevens Ireland Wolfhounds Emerging Ireland Universities U20s Schoolboys Women 's Senior Sevens URC teams Connacht Leinster Munster Ulster Competitions European European Rugby Champions Cup European Rugby Challenge Cup United Rugby Championship British and Irish Cup Celtic Cup National IRFU Interprovincial Championship IRFU Women 's Interprovincial Series All-Ireland League All-Ireland Cup Provincial leagues Connacht Senior League Leinster Senior League Munster Senior League Ulster\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 34, \"text\": \": //en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php ?\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d02\", \"start\": 35, \"end\": 466, \"text\": \"title=Munster_Schools_Rugby_Senior_Cup & oldid=1281661069 `` Categories : High school rugby union competitions in Ireland Rugby union competitions in Munster 1909 establishments in Ireland Hidden categories : Articles with short description Short description matches Wikidata All articles with unsourced statements Articles with unsourced statements from January 2022 This page was last edited on 21 March 2025 , at 18:23 ( UTC ) .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d02\", \"start\": 467, \"end\": 577, \"text\": \"Text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License ; additional terms may apply .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0095-2ddea335a0e9:d02\", \"start\": 578, \"end\": 649, \"text\": \"By using this site , you agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"